      "name": "Spend FAB",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-spend",
      "description": "Extended FAB for keypad-first quick add; shown on Today and Month.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-fab-spend\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M3 17.25V21h3.75L17.81 9.94l-3.75-3.75L3 17.25zM20.71 7.04a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.41l-2.34-2.34a1 1 0 0 0-1.41 0l-1.83 1.83 3.75 3.75 1.83-1.83z\"/></svg>Spend</button>",
      "css": ".ds-fab-spend{font-family:'Atkinson Hyperlegible Next',sans-serif;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;height:56px;padding:0 20px 0 16px;border:none;border-radius:16px;background:#15245C;color:#FBFCFA;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25);cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s}.ds-fab-spend:hover{background:#22347A}.ds-fab-spend:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #C7D6EB;outline-offset:2px}.ds-fab-spend:active{background:#0E1A46}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
